    "label": "18",
    "prompt": "Show that\n$$\\sqrt{\\frac{\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta+\\cot\\theta}{\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta-\\cot\\theta}}=\\left|\\frac{\\sin\\theta}{1-\\cos\\theta}\\right|.$$",
